{"id": "2390807", "name": "וריאציית פרמטרים – השלמת y₁, y₂, y_p בנפרד, x^a ו-x^b בתחום x > c", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p></p>\n<p>נתונה המד\"ר הבאה:</p>\n<p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\({{CT:0}}\\)</p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl;\">נתון כי קיים פתרון למד\"ר ההומוגנית מהצורה \\(y^\\alpha\\).</p>\n<p style=\"direction: rtl;\">מצאו את הפתרון הכללי למד\"ר בתחום &nbsp;\\[x&gt;{{CT:1}}\\]. הפתרון הוא מהצורה</p>\n<p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(c_1\\cdot y_1 +c_2\\cdot y_2 + y_p\\)</p>\n<p>עבור \\(c_1,c_2\\) קבועים,&nbsp;&nbsp;\\(y_1,y_2\\) פתרונות בת\"ל למד\"ר ההומגנית ו \\(y_p\\) פתרון פרטי למד\"ר הנתונה.&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>השלימו:</p>\n<p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(y_1(x)= \\)[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>\n<p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(y_2(x)= \\)[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]</p>\n<p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(y_p(x)= \\)[[input:ansp]] [[validation:ansp]]<br></p>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 35, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 35, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ansp", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 35, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "satisfiedHODE(yy,ODE):= block([sa1,sa2,sa3],sa1:subst(y=yy,ODE),sa2:ev(sa1,nouns),sa3:trigsimp(fullratsimp((radcan(sa2)))),is(sa3));\n\nlinearInd(y1,y2):= block([W], W:y1*diff(y2,x)-y2*diff(y1,x),W:trigsimp(fullratsimp((radcan(W)))), is(W#0) );\n\ncorrecty1:satisfiedHODE(ans1,Ly=0);\ncorrecty2:satisfiedHODE(ans2,Ly=0);\nlinIn:linearInd(ans1,ans2);\n\n\n", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correcty1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הפונקציה הראשונה אכן פתרון למדר ההומגנית</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הפונקציה הראשונה אינה פתרון למדר ההומגנית<br></p>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correcty2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הפונקציה השניה אכן פתרון למדר ההומגנית<br></p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הפונקציה השניה אינה פתרון למדר ההומגנית<br></p>"}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "linIn", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הפתרונות אכן בתל</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הפתרו